  "title": "Frontier Releases 2026 GoWild Fall & Winter Pass at Just $199 With Immediate Access, Providing Up to Nearly Seven Months of Unlimited Travel",
  "summary": "DENVER – August 4, 2026 – Frontier Airlines (Nasdaq: ULCC) today launched its 2026 GoWild Fall & Winter Pass with immediate access, offering consumers the chance to purchase the pass now for just $199 and begin enjoying unlimited flights right away, rather than waiting for the typical pass period to begin. With the pass valid through Feb. 28...",
